Z||000004||wkayl||08-27-2000||01:42 AM||||What is the red switch under the deck lid switch.  I installed a bezzel that had the rear window defoger switch and hooked it up to my garage door opener.  With the guts of the opener removed from it's case it fits behind the bezzel.  I left the 9-volt batt hooked to it and soldered wires from the switch to the contact points of the opener.  Only problem is to show off with it you have to be within a block of your house.||||reg||1
